From 5cb2d2a449cca39834f15a05761133ffb8c305da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JoshuaHayesWasHere <josh.hayes121@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 20:26:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): a jstack task held only on its own crew says crew
 owes, not held

jbus's held.json names who owns each hold it keeps: crew for a wait only the task's own crew
clears, such as a Proved: line to rerun, and user for the rest. The tree drew every hold as
held <age>, so four pull requests that waited on their crew read like waits on the user. The
task now carries the hold's who, a crew-owned hold draws crew owes <age>, any other draws
held <age> as before, and a row that asks you still says so first. jmerge's holds are the user's.
